    [Doc][Misc] Clarify SigLIP2 tutorial paths and expected outputs (#18464)
    
    Add path placeholders for local images and ImageNet files, remind users
    to stop the online service before offline tests, and include expected
    logs for serve and embeddings.
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Use variables to remind users to modify the directories to their
    datasets/ground truth file etc. before runing accuracy test.
    Add reminders to close the server before running the offline evaluation.
    Add expected outputs and examples in section 5 and 6.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    No
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    No test required.
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/8cc9aa5ad350f6f80cf3bebb298d410803ff75a9
    
    Signed-off-by: LIJIAN1998 <844299030@qq.com>
